    "original":"[3] <1v> @ namas tārāyai || evaṃ mayā śrutam ekasmi[n samaye] bhagavān sukhāvatyāṃ viharati sma | atha khalu bhagavān mahāśriyaṃ dṛṣṭvā mañjuśriyam āryāvalokiteśvaraṃ ca bodhisattvaṃ mahāsattva[m e]tad avocat | yaḥ khalu punar mañjuśrīr mahāśriyo devatāyā nāmadvādaśakaṃ jñāsyati | bhikṣur vā bhikṣuṇī vā upāsako vā upāsikā vā | anyo vā yaḥ ka[ścid dhā]rayiṣyati vācayiṣyati likhiṣyati likhāpayiṣyati | na tasya dāridryabhayaṃ bhaviṣyati | dāridryaṃ prahāya āḍhyo bhaviṣyati | atha khalu bhagavān mahāśri[yo de]vatāyā nāmadvādaśakaṃ bhāṣate sma | tadyathā oṃ lakṣmīḥ śrīḥ padmamālinī dhanādhipatiḥ gaurī mahāyaśāḥ padmanetrī kartrī ma[hādyutiḥ | annadāyinī | ratna]prabhā | mahāśrīś ceti | atra mantrapadāni | jini 2 glini 2 kāyaviśodhani vāgviśodhani manaḥsaṃśodhani | sisi sisi | nimi 2 alakṣmīṃ [me nāśaya svāhā |] [the rest is lost] [Mahāśrī-nāma-dhāraṇī]",
